    {
      "source": "As you can see, all you need to declare is a <code>SqlSessionFactoryBean</code> as <code>MyBatisJdbcConfiguration</code> relies on a <code>SqlSession</code> bean to be available in the <code>ApplicationContext</code> eventually.",
      "translation": "如您所见，您只需声明一个 `<code>SqlSessionFactoryBean</code>`，因为 `MyBatisJdbcConfiguration` 最终依赖于在 `ApplicationContext` 中提供一个可用的 `<code>SqlSession</code>`  Bean。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "For each operation in <code>CrudRepository</code>, Spring Data JDBC runs multiple statements.\nIf there is a <a href=\"https://github.com/mybatis/mybatis-3/blob/master/src/main/java/org/apache/ibatis/session/SqlSessionFactory.java\"><code>SqlSessionFactory</code></a> in the application context, Spring Data checks, for each step, whether the <code>SessionFactory</code> offers a statement.\nIf one is found, that statement (including its configured mapping to an entity) is used.",
      "translation": "对于 `<code>CrudRepository`</code> 中的每个操作，Spring Data JDBC 都会执行多个语句。如果应用程序上下文中存在 <a href=\"https://github.com/mybatis/mybatis-3/blob/master/src/main/java/org/apache/ibatis/session/SqlSessionFactory.java\"><code>SqlSessionFactory</code></a>，则 Spring Data 会在每一步检查该 `<code>SessionFactory</code>` 是否提供相应的语句。如果找到这样的语句（包括其配置的实体映射），则使用该语句。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The name of the statement is constructed by concatenating the fully qualified name of the entity type with <code>Mapper.</code> and a <code>String</code> determining the kind of statement.\nFor example, if an instance of <code>org.example.User</code> is to be inserted, Spring Data JDBC looks for a statement named <code>org.example.UserMapper.insert</code>.",
      "translation": "语句名称由实体类型的完全限定名与<code>Mapper.</code>以及一个用于确定语句类型的<code>String</code>拼接而成。例如，若要插入<code>org.example.User</code>的实例，Spring Data JDBC 会查找名为<code>org.example.UserMapper.insert</code>的语句。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>get(&lt;key&gt;)</code>: ID of the referencing entity, where <code>&lt;key&gt;</code> is the name of the back reference column provided by the <code>NamingStrategy</code>.",
      "translation": "`get(<key>)`: 引用实体的 ID，其中 `<key>` 是由 `NamingStrategy` 提供的回引列的名称。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "When the statement is run, an instance of <code><a class=\"xref attachment apiref\" href=\"../api/java/org/springframework/data/jdbc/mybatis/MyBatisContext.html\">MyBatisContext</a></code> gets passed as an argument, which makes various arguments available to the statement.",
      "translation": "执行该语句时，会传入一个 <code><a class=\"xref attachment apiref\" href=\"../api/java/org/springframework/data/jdbc/mybatis/MyBatisContext.html\">MyBatisContext</a></code> 实例作为参数，从而使该语句能够访问各种参数。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Select a set of entities that is referenced by another entity. The type of the referencing entity is used for the prefix. The referenced entities type is used as the suffix. <em>This method is deprecated. Use <code>findAllByPath</code> instead</em>",
      "translation": "选择一组由另一个实体引用的实体。引用实体的类型用作前缀，被引用实体的类型用作后缀。<em>此方法已弃用，请使用<code>findAllByPath</code></em>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "All <code>find*</code> methods. If no query is defined for <code>findAllByPath</code>",
      "translation": "所有 `find*` 方法。如果未为 `findAllByPath` 定义查询，则...",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>getIdentifier</code>: The <code>Identifier</code> holding the id of the aggregate root plus the keys and list indexes of all path elements.",
      "translation": "<code>getIdentifier</code>：持有聚合根 ID 以及所有路径元素的键和列表索引的 <code>Identifier</code>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The easiest way to properly plug MyBatis into Spring Data JDBC is by importing <code>MyBatisJdbcConfiguration</code> into you application configuration:",
      "translation": "将 `<code>MyBatisJdbcConfiguration</code>` 导入到您的应用程序配置中，是正确地将 MyBatis 集成到 Spring Data JDBC 中最简单的方法：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>getInstance</code>: the instance to be saved.",
      "translation": "<code>getInstance</code>：要保存的实例。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>getInstance</code>: The instance to be saved.",
      "translation": "<code>getInstance</code>：要保存的实例。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>getId</code>: The ID of the instance to be deleted.",
      "translation": "<code>getId</code>：要删除的实例的 ID。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>getDomainType</code>: The type of the entity to be deleted.",
      "translation": "<code>getDomainType</code>：待删除实体的类型。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>getDomainType</code>: The types of the entities to be deleted.",
      "translation": "<code>getDomainType</code>：待删除实体的类型。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>getId</code>: The ID of the aggregate root for which referenced entities are to be deleted.",
      "translation": "<code>getId</code>：要删除其引用实体的聚合根实体的 ID。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>getId</code>: The ID of the entity to load.",
      "translation": "<code>getId</code>：要加载的实体的 ID。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>getId</code>: A list of ID values of the entities to load.",
      "translation": "<code>getId</code>：要加载的实体的 ID 值列表。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>getId</code>: The ID of the entity referencing the entities to be loaded.",
      "translation": "<code>getId</code>：引用待加载实体的实体 ID。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>getSort</code>: The sorting specification.",
      "translation": "<code>getSort</code>：排序规范。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>getPageable</code>: The paging specification.",
      "translation": "<code>getPageable</code>：分页规范。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
