      "translation": "<code>getDomainType</code>：要计数的聚合根类型。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The CRUD operations and query methods can be delegated to MyBatis.\nThis section describes how to configure Spring Data JDBC to integrate with MyBatis and which conventions to follow to hand over the running of the queries as well as the mapping to the library.",
      "translation": "CRUD 操作和查询方法可以委托给 MyBatis。本节将介绍如何配置 Spring Data JDBC 以集成 MyBatis，以及应遵循哪些约定来将查询的执行和映射工作交由该库处理。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The following table describes the available MyBatis statements:",
      "translation": "下表描述了可用的 MyBatis 语句：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Inserts a single entity. This also applies for entities referenced by the aggregate root.",
      "translation": "插入单个实体。此规则同样适用于聚合根所引用的实体。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Updates a single entity. This also applies for entities referenced by the aggregate root.",
      "translation": "更新单个实体。此规则同样适用于聚合根所引用的实体。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Deletes a single entity.",
      "translation": "删除单个实体。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Deletes all entities referenced by any aggregate root of the type used as prefix with the given property path.\nNote that the type used for prefixing the statement name is the name of the aggregate root, not the one of the entity to be deleted.",
      "translation": "删除所有由给定属性路径前缀所指定的聚合根类型引用的实体。请注意，用于前缀语句名称的类型是聚合根的名称，而非待删除实体的名称。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Deletes all aggregate roots of the type used as the prefix",
      "translation": "删除所有以该类型作为前缀的聚合根。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Deletes all entities referenced by an aggregate root with the given propertyPath",
      "translation": "删除由给定属性路径引用的聚合根中的所有实体。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Selects an aggregate root by ID",
      "translation": "根据 ID 选择聚合根",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Select all aggregate roots",
      "translation": "选择所有聚合根",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Select a set of aggregate roots by ID values",
      "translation": "根据 ID 值选择一组聚合根",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Select a set of entities that is referenced by another entity via a property path.",
      "translation": "选择一组实体，该组实体通过属性路径被另一个实体引用。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Select all aggregate roots, sorted",
      "translation": "选择所有聚合根，按顺序排列",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Select a page of aggregate roots, optionally sorted",
      "translation": "选择聚合根页面，可选择排序。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Count the number of aggregate root of the type used as prefix",
      "translation": "统计用作前缀的聚合根的数量。",
      "count": 1
    },
